**Project Title:** University Management System (Admin + Public Portal)

**Project Type:** Full-stack web application (Admin dashboard + public website)

## 1. Tech Stack

### Frontend

- React (Vite)
- React Router (routing)
- Tailwind CSS (utility styling)
- Flowbite (UI components)
- React Hook Form (form handling)
- Framer Motion (animations)
- React Icons

### Backend (existing API)

- REST API (external backend provided)
- Base URL:
  `https://api.nsprowebtech.com/backend/api/v1`

---

## 2. Main App Structure

The app has **two separate UI systems**:

### 1. Public Website

Accessible to everyone:

- Home
- About
- Contact
- News
- Login

Uses:

```
PublicLayout
```

### 2. Admin Panel

Accessible after login:

- Dashboard
- Students
- Academics
- Examinations
- Events
- Communications
- Reports
- Settings

Uses:

```
AdminLayout
```

Each layout has:

- Separate header
- Separate sidebar
- Separate theme logic

---

## 3. Routing Structure

Example routes:

### Public Routes

```
/
 /about
 /contact
 /news
 /login
```

### Admin Routes

```
/admin
/admin/students
/admin/students/add
/admin/settings/site-settings
```

---

## 4. Folder Structure

```
src/
│
├── api/
